<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>About Us - NPTEL Exam Prep</title>
   <style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }
    
    body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        padding: 20px;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }
    
    header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    
    h1 {
        color: #333;
    }
    
    h2 {
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .description {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        line-height: 1.8;
    }
    
    .feature-list {
        margin: 15px 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
        list-style-type: disc;
    }
    
    .feature-list li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: #444;
    }
    
    p {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #555;
    }
    
    p strong {
        color: #222;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    
    .description, .roadmap, .video {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    
    .responsive-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }
    
    .video-container {
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 Aspect Ratio */
        height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        max-width: 100%;
    }
    
    .video-container iframe {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }
    
    footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 10px;
        background-color: #333;
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }
    
    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
        body {
            padding: 10px;
        }
    
        h1, h2 {
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }
    
        p {
            font-size: 1em;
        }
    }
    
    @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        h1, h2 {
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
    
        p {
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    }
    
   </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="description">
        <h2>About Our Website</h2>
        <p>Our platform is designed to support students preparing for <strong>NPTEL exams</strong>. Here’s what we offer:</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>Dedicated <strong>exam and quiz section</strong> for NPTEL course assignments.</li>
            <li>Access to <strong>mock exams</strong> and <strong>quizzes</strong> that align with NPTEL coursework.</li>
            <li>Includes <strong>previous years' questions (PYQs)</strong> to help with focused preparation.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To unlock these features, students can create an account for a nominal fee of <strong>₹29</strong>.</p>
        <p>We aim to enhance the <strong>NPTEL learning experience</strong> by offering tailored academic resources and focused practice materials.</p>
    </section>
    

    <section class="roadmap">
        <h2>Roadmap: How to Use Our Website</h2>
        <img src="/images/quizzer_roadmap.jpg" alt="Roadmap of how to use our website" class="responsive-image">
    </section>

    <section class="video">
        <h2>See What's Inside</h2>
        <div class="video-container">
             <iframe  src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wHt7NSMWs-8?si=_urOlkDpqmndKbVe" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Quizzer. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
